        "content": [{
          "attachment": {
            "data": "ASSESSMENT AND PLAN:\nPatient is a 56-year-old female with a history of type 2 diabetes mellitus (E11.9), diagnosed in 2015. She presents for a routine follow-up visit.\n\nLABORATORY:\nHbA1c 9.8% (2024-11-15) — elevated above goal of less than 9%. Previous value was 8.4% in June 2024, indicating worsening glycemic control.\nFasting glucose: 218 mg/dL\n\nPLAN:\n1. Increase metformin to 2000mg daily\n2. Add glipizide 5mg daily\n3. Diabetes education referral placed\n4. Repeat HbA1c in 3 months\n5. Continue blood pressure and lipid management"
          }
        }]
      }
